    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1.1
  m_Text: "Dear Friend,\r\n\r\nI am worried about my child lately. She often laughs
    suddenly, talks to herself, and even speaks to her teddy. Her mother blames me
    for spoiling her, but I feel something is wrong. Please give me advice. I want
    to keep this matter private.\r\n\r\n\u2014 A Confused Father"
